# Xyne Desk compose
> A new email composed from a Desk channel is sent through its mailbox and tracked as a ticket.

## Composed email is sent and listed as a Desk ticket
* Setting up Desk channel "channel-desk-compose" for user "admin-1"
* composing Desk email ticket "ticket-desk-compose" from channel "channel-desk-compose" for user "admin-1"
* verifying fake Gmail sent composed Desk email "ticket-desk-compose" for user "admin-1"
* Verifying Desk ticket "ticket-desk-compose" is listed in channel "channel-desk-compose" for user "admin-1"
